<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="git-addon-git-menu">
  <title>Git Menu</title>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>Git menu</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <body>
    <p id="p_git_menu_overview">After you install the Git Client add-on, a top-level
      <uicontrol>Git</uicontrol> menu is available in the main menu bar. Use this menu as a
      repository-level entry point for common Git actions.</p>
    <p id="p_git_menu_scope">Most actions from the <uicontrol>Git</uicontrol> menu apply to the
      current working copy selected in the <xref
        href="git-addon-git-staging-view-interface.dita#git-addon-git-staging-view-interface"
        ><uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol> view</xref>. If an action needs a Git repository and
      no working copy is selected, the Git Client prompts you to select or create one when
      possible.</p>
    <p>
      <fig id="fig_git_menu">
        <title>Git Menu</title>
        <image href="../img/git-addon/menu/git_menu.png" id="image_qdw_ttk_gjc" placement="inline"/>
      </fig>
    </p>
    <section id="section_git_menu_repository_setup">
      <title>Repository Setup and Location Actions</title>
      <p id="p_git_menu_repository_setup_actions">Use these actions to clone a repository, open an
        existing repository, create a repository in the project, or open the working copy folder
        outside <ph keyref="product"/>.</p>
      <ul id="ul_git_menu_repository_setup_actions">
        <li id="li_git_menu_clone_repository"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-repository-working-copy.dita#git-addon-actions-repository-working-copy/action_clone_repository"
            ><uicontrol>Clone repository...</uicontrol></xref> - Creates a local copy of a remote
          repository.</li>
        <li id="li_git_menu_open_repository"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-repository-working-copy.dita#git-addon-actions-repository-working-copy/action_open_repository_select_working_copy"
            ><uicontrol>Open repository...</uicontrol></xref> - Selects an existing local
          repository.</li>
        <li id="li_git_menu_create_repository_in_project"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-repository-working-copy.dita#git-addon-actions-repository-working-copy/action_create_repository_in_project"
            ><uicontrol>Create repository in project</uicontrol></xref> - Initializes a repository
          in the project folder.</li>
        <li id="li_git_menu_show_working_copy_in"><uicontrol>Show working copy in</uicontrol> -
          Opens a submenu for opening the working copy folder outside the editor:
          <ul id="ul_git_menu_show_working_copy_in_actions">
            <li id="li_git_menu_show_working_copy_in_finder"><xref
                href="git-addon-actions-repository-working-copy.dita#git-addon-actions-repository-working-copy/action_show_working_copy_in_finder"
                ><uicontrol>Finder</uicontrol></xref> - Opens the working copy folder in
              Finder.</li>
            <li id="li_git_menu_show_working_copy_in_terminal"><xref
                href="git-addon-actions-repository-working-copy.dita#git-addon-actions-repository-working-copy/action_show_working_copy_in_terminal"
                ><uicontrol>Terminal</uicontrol></xref> - Opens the working copy folder in
              Terminal.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        <fig id="fig_git_menu_show_in_submenu">
          <title>Git Menu Show Working Copy In Submenu</title>
          <image href="../img/git-addon/menu/git_show_in_submenu.png" placement="inline"
            id="image_git_menu_show_in_submenu"/>
        </fig>
      </p>
    </section>
    <section id="section_git_menu_synchronization">
      <title>Synchronization Actions</title>
      <p id="p_git_menu_synchronization_actions">Use these actions to publish local commits or bring
        remote changes into the local repository.</p>
      <ul id="ul_git_menu_synchronization_actions">
        <li id="li_git_menu_push"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts.dita#git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts/action_push"
            ><uicontrol>Push</uicontrol></xref> - Publishes local commits.</li>
        <li id="li_git_menu_pull"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts.dita#git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts/action_pull"
            ><uicontrol><image href="../img/NextReference16.png" id="image_d3h_b2f_njc"
            />Pull</uicontrol></xref> - Opens a submenu for bringing remote commits into the
          local repository:
          <ul id="ul_git_menu_pull_actions">
            <li id="li_git_menu_pull_merge"><xref
                href="git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts.dita#git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts/action_pull_merge"
                ><uicontrol>Pull (merge)</uicontrol></xref> - Pulls and creates a merge commit if
              needed.</li>
            <li id="li_git_menu_pull_rebase"><xref
                href="git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts.dita#git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts/action_pull_rebase"
                ><uicontrol>Pull (rebase)</uicontrol></xref> - Pulls and reapplies local
              commits.</li>
            <li id="li_git_menu_pull_other_branch"><xref
                href="git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts.dita#git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts/action_pull_other_branch"
                ><uicontrol>Pull...</uicontrol></xref> - Pulls from another remote branch.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li id="li_git_menu_fetch"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts.dita#git-addon-actions-synchronize-conflicts/action_fetch"
            ><uicontrol><image href="../img/git-addon/icons/Fetch16.png"
                id="image_qbc_5df_njc"/>Fetch</uicontrol></xref> - Retrieves updates from all
          configured remotes without merging them into the current branch.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        <fig id="fig_git_menu_pull_submenu">
          <title>Git Menu Pull Submenu</title>
          <image href="../img/git-addon/menu/git_pull_submenu.png" placement="inline"
            id="image_git_menu_pull_submenu"/>
        </fig>
      </p>
    </section>
    <section id="section_git_menu_views_information">
      <title>Views and Repository Information</title>
      <p id="p_git_menu_views_information_actions">Use these actions to open Git Client views,
        inspect branches and tags, view history, or open submodules.</p>
      <ul id="ul_git_menu_views_information_actions">
        <li id="li_git_menu_show_staging"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_show_staging"
            ><uicontrol>Show staging</uicontrol></xref> - Opens the main staging view.</li>
        <li id="li_git_menu_show_branches"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_show_branches"
            ><uicontrol>Show branches</uicontrol></xref> - Opens branch management.</li>
        <li id="li_git_menu_show_tags"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_show_tags"
            ><uicontrol>Show tags...</uicontrol></xref> - Opens tag management.</li>
        <li id="li_git_menu_show_history"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_show_history"
            ><uicontrol>Show history</uicontrol></xref> - Opens repository history.</li>
        <li id="li_git_menu_submodule"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-advanced.dita#git-addon-actions-advanced/action_submodule"
            ><uicontrol>Submodule</uicontrol></xref> - Opens a repository submodule.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section id="section_git_menu_stash_actions">
      <title>Stash Actions</title>
      <p id="p_git_menu_stash_actions">Use these actions to save local changes temporarily or open
        the list of existing stashes.</p>
      <ul id="ul_git_menu_stash_actions">
        <li id="li_git_menu_stash_changes"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-advanced.dita#git-addon-actions-advanced/action_stash_changes"
            ><uicontrol>Stash changes...</uicontrol></xref> - Saves working-copy changes for
          later.</li>
        <li id="li_git_menu_list_stashes"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-advanced.dita#git-addon-actions-advanced/action_list_stashes"
            ><uicontrol>List stashes...</uicontrol></xref> - Lists saved stashes.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section id="section_git_menu_remote_and_settings">
      <title>Remote Repository and Settings Actions</title>
      <p id="p_git_menu_remote_settings_actions">Use these actions to manage remotes, track a remote
        branch, edit repository configuration, or open Git Client settings.</p>
      <ul id="ul_git_menu_remote_settings_actions">
        <li id="li_git_menu_manage_remote_repositories"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-configuration.dita#git-addon-actions-configuration/action_manage_remote_repositories"
            ><uicontrol>Manage remote repositories...</uicontrol></xref> - Adds, edits, or deletes
          remotes.</li>
        <li id="li_git_menu_track_remote_branch"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-branches-history.dita#git-addon-actions-branches-history/action_track_remote_branch"
            ><uicontrol>Track remote branch...</uicontrol></xref> - Sets the branch used for
          fetch, pull, and push.</li>
        <li id="li_git_menu_edit_config"><xref
            href="git-addon-actions-configuration.dita#git-addon-actions-configuration/action_edit_repository_config_file"
            ><uicontrol>Edit repository "config" file</uicontrol></xref> - Opens the repository
          configuration file.</li>
        <li id="li_git_menu_settings"><uicontrol>Settings</uicontrol> - Opens a submenu with
          settings-related actions:
          <ul id="ul_git_menu_settings_actions">
            <li id="li_git_menu_settings_preferences"><xref
                href="git-addon-actions-configuration.dita#git-addon-actions-configuration/action_preferences"
                ><uicontrol>Preferences</uicontrol></xref> - Opens the Git Client preferences
              page.</li>
            <li id="li_git_menu_settings_reset_credentials"><xref
                href="git-addon-actions-configuration.dita#git-addon-actions-configuration/action_reset_all_credentials"
                ><uicontrol>Reset all credentials</uicontrol></xref> - Removes stored
              credentials.</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        <fig id="fig_git_menu_settings_submenu">
          <title>Git Menu Settings Submenu</title>
          <image href="../img/git-addon/menu/git_settings_submenu.png" placement="inline"
            id="image_git_menu_settings_submenu"/>
        </fig>
      </p>
    </section>
  </body>
</topic>